# Symbolization tooling: peers of the objcopy/nm/strip aliases above.
# //src/cerise/tools/symbolize drives llvm_symbolizer as a subprocess to resolve
# symbolizer-markup {{{bt}}}/{{{pc}}} frames against the .build-id store; gdb init
# snippets (validation/run-qemu.sh --gdb) and manual addr2line lookups use these.
# Point at the PREBUILT multitool (like llvm_objcopy), NOT the from-source
# @llvm-project targets — the latter trigger a multi-minute LLVM build in the
# boot-test harness and the symbolize tests.
